    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb84e280369be9f0e00bd47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂喂，那是啥啊！？怎么写着『恭喜三冠』啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "11429f91218f960766c33ba32776a21b9207aa489c479d82ffd72881c9492003",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
