      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c4112df184fe0789d06cf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "估计是谁搞错了放飞的气球吧。\n舞台上的米浴大概也注意到了飞向天空的这些气球。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89009ef9b34a4eae7fa3eb06e04f8865bf6f4a8bd7d311e3ace0d90fe9f8efd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6efe1e27d2e02df29419fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴正用微弱而颤抖的声音唱着歌。\n感觉这种胜者舞台相当难熬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65b9bf84c18af35a174464d59494e6b3fc3179a3227c3e9a6b4f59cec6dfaf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02621159be4b4c01579e6a23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她对外面世界的人说道\n『我来使用魔法，实现你们的愿望吧』",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb23973dd69108b2bc095d30444386d4b0252676df1bd9f26a9d38c60cfee7e",
