    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f99f6d8995d82d6b09009eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "人们并没有接受，\n打破了美浦波旁无败赛马娘传说的这种功绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "060027a6c22beb25078d75976277ff505a323a30403ea3d7247470dfb16388e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e68bc0bfbea963828caba6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而正当她要使用魔法的时候——\n人们纷纷逃开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec604e0eeb020964922434806117b0834d05fdb0531ebd6d1dc7540a8a33e6da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d59c876019bcb2cd72cf6bb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种状况并不是没有预料过。\n只是，会场的气氛――程度远远超出了之前的预想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78667120b09d6abdb73b5ff5187243383025608779d4bcdbccfa528e44550283",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
