      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆带着一反常态的认真表情。\n平时很热闹的训练员室也被寂静包裹着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51a2320e8aef9c3c379bc04f1cf900a636ca5fb225165d85924f9a009ffd8f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
